OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 6 JUN
OL,4,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,5,     GTom Service introduces the best
OL,6,     Gclassical music and the latest
OL,7,     Gstories from the arts world. Tom
OL,8,     Gmeets conductor Ryan Wigglesworth
OL,9,     Gto chat about this year's
OL,10,     GAldeburgh Festival.
OL,11,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,12,     GJools is joined by the singer
OL,13,     Gsongwriter Emeli Sande with music
OL,14,     Gby Dvorak, Vivaldi and
OL,15,     GKhachaturian.
OL,16,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,17,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,18,     G1600, Florence. At a lavish
OL,19,     GMedici wedding, Jacopo Peri'd
OL,20,     GEuridice introdces a radical new
OL,21,     Gidea: drama told entirely through
OL,22,     Gmusic. This is the birth of opera.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
