OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 6 JUN
OL,4,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,5,     GJess Gillam is joined by Italian
OL,6,     Gcontemporary classical pianist
OL,7,     Gand composer Olivia Belli for a
OL,8,     Glistening party, including music
OL,9,     Gby Arvo Part, Gino Paoli, Vivaldi
OL,10,     Gand The Beatles.
OL,11,G1800FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,12,     GVocalist Elaine Mitchener and
OL,13,     Glutenist Elizabeth Kenny present
OL,14,     Ga lunchtime concert journey
OL,15,     Gthrough the lyrical poetry of
OL,16,     Gsongwriters and composers over
OL,17,     Gthe centuries.
OL,18,G2000FOpera on 3: Angel's Bone
OL,19,     GThe UK premiere of Pulitzer-prize-
OL,20,     Gwinning opera Angel's Bone from
OL,21,     GManchester's Aviva Studios.
